{"id":1024,"profile":{"ID":2666,"title":"Artsy Marie","content":"","attr_title":"","menu_type":"profile","url":"\/profile\/artsy-marie\/","slug":"artsy-marie","parent":"1623","coords":"","offset":"","confirmation_status":"","event_length_seconds":"","point_of_contact":"","guest_type":"","event_type":"","appearance_type":"","notes":"","classes":["presenter"],"post":{"ID":1024,"post_author":"1","post_date":"2021-09-19 14:35:26","post_date_gmt":"2021-09-19 14:35:26","post_content":"\u003C!-- wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI\u2019m a multidisciplinary POC artist from Kentucky. I\u2019m a VR enthusiast and a life long creative. When I was a kid I used to make houses out of paper, when I was a teen I played a copious amount of The Sims, when I went to college I started my art business doing professional photography, graphic design, web design, painting and illustration.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\n\u003C!-- wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt wasn\u2019t until 2020 that I discovered a love for digital 3D modeling. Exploring social apps on the Oculus Quest during the pandemic, I was immediately drawn to building worlds for people to socialize in.\u003Cbr\u003EIn the past 12 months I have created and shared over 150 originally crafted VR templates and there are over 2,100 worlds that have my signature on them.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\n\u003C!-- wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI design all of my environments, structures and furnishings from scratch, having no previous experience in 3D or VR before the joining Altspace. I am the first world builder to successfully monetize templates via Patreon memberships, with over 200 Patrons since November of 2020. I\u2019ve paved the way for other artists in the space to get paid and I teach dozens of aspiring world builders daily and free of charge. Having hosted over 50 events in Altspace, I\u2019ve also introduced countless users to the platform.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\n\u003C!-- wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI have worked with several notable organizations within VR, such as Naughty by Nature, Public Enemy, The Harlem Film House, BRCvr, DreamlandXR and NFT Oasis and many of my colleagues have as well.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E","post_title":"Artsy Marie","post_excerpt":"","post_status":"publish","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","post_password":"","post_name":"artsy-marie","to_ping":"","pinged":"","post_modified":"2022-11-30 15:16:43","post_modified_gmt":"2022-11-30 15:16:43","post_content_filtered":"","post_parent":0,"guid":"https:\/\/webxr.events\/?post_type=profile&#038;p=1024","menu_order":0,"post_type":"profile","post_mime_type":"","comment_count":"0","filter":"raw"},"post_type":"profile","meta":{"_edit_lock":["1669821405:1"],"_edit_last":["1"],"timezone":["-7| PDT"],"_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes":["2"],"first_name":["Artsy"],"email":["artsy@artsyvr.com"],"profile_title":["3D Designer & Social VR Architect"],"company":["Artsy VR"],"website":["https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/in\/artsy-marie-530536121\/"],"linkedin":["https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/in\/artsy-marie-530536121\/"],"portfolio":["https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/in\/artsy-marie-530536121\/"],"discord":["Artsymarie#8687"],"_thumbnail_id":["1029"],"_yoast_wpseo_content_score":["60"],"suppress_profile_page":["0"],"PhD":["0"],"use_aframe":["0"],"registration_pending":["0"],"invitation_sent":["0"],"calendar_sent":["0"],"calendar_confirmed":["0"],"signed_release":["0"],"request_profile_update":["0"],"no_profile_link":["0"],"sort_name":["Marie, Artsy"],"_yoast_wpseo_wordproof_timestamp":[""],"instagram":["https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/artsyinvr\/"]},"thumbnail":false,"children":[]},"company":"Artsy VR","profile_title":"3D Designer & Social VR Architect","sort":"Marie, Artsy","slug":"artsy-marie","events":[{"event_id":2515,"event_slug":"the-2nd-polys-ceremony","event_key":"polys2","event_title":"The